# prompt: sword slash connecting with a body
# tags: slash, hit, melee, combat
# A hit that lands is a swing with something in the way, so the swing is here
# too — 130 ms of it before anything else starts. That gap is what a game needs
# to line the sound up with the animation, and it is why this is one recipe
# rather than a whoosh the engine has to schedule against a thud.
sound "slash hit" 500ms impact
  swing: noise white >> bp ~1600Hz[700..3600] -> ~4200Hz[2000..8000] in 120ms Q1.6 | gain 0.26 attack 40ms decay 120ms
  cut: noise pink >> hp ~2200Hz[1000..5000] | gain 0.28 attack 0ms decay 60ms delay 130ms
  flesh: sub ~90Hz[45..160] -> 50Hz in 80ms | gain 0.34 attack 3ms decay 220ms delay 130ms
  ring: modal metal ~1900Hz[900..4000] Q70 | gain 0.16 decay 260ms delay 135ms
